Part 3: Amazon Q — Use Cases, Best Practices and Security
Use Case 1: Enterprise Knowledge

One of the major use cases for Amazon Q Business is creating an internal knowledge assistant.

Employees may have questions such as:

Where can I find our travel policy?

How do I submit an expense?

What is our onboarding process?

Instead of searching through multiple enterprise systems, employees can ask Amazon Q directly.

Amazon Q can retrieve relevant enterprise information and provide a natural-language response.

This can reduce repetitive questions and make organizational knowledge easier to access.
Use Case 2: IT Support

Amazon Q Business can also be used for internal IT support.

Employees may have questions about:

    VPN access

    Internal applications

    Password processes

    Software

    Network access

    Troubleshooting procedures

If the organization has documentation covering these issues, Amazon Q can help users find the relevant information.

With an appropriate integration, the assistant can potentially help create support tickets.

